  showScore: 0
  dialogues:
  - character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: c8fcfa5882242b84b8bf1fb55659059e, type: 2}
    emotion: 0
    text: The tendering has gone well. You have received a minimum of three quotes
      for each package of works and the quality is generally good.
  - character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: c8fcfa5882242b84b8bf1fb55659059e, type: 2}
    emotion: 0
    text: The original client budget was 10-12million. Your current return is sitting
      at a cost of 11.5 million and you are confident 95% of the requirements are
      covered.
  - character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: c8fcfa5882242b84b8bf1fb55659059e, type: 2}
    emotion: 0
    text: As part of final compilation you need to add in line items and any final
      costs you think are not included.
